  "description": "Multi-tenant WhatsApp Cloud API (Meta Graph API v24) toolkit for .NET 8. Send text, media, interactive, template, carousel and Flow messages; sync and create message templates; run broadcast campaigns with a queue worker; process webhooks (messages, statuses, account updates); keyword and AI (OpenAI/Flowise) chatbot replies; WhatsApp Flows; catalog orders with Razorpay/PhonePe payments; Embedded Signup. Ships an EF Core SQL Server schema and stores every tenant secret (access token, WABA id, app secret, payment keys) encrypted in the database.",
